            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kayjay"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was looking for a way to use some mangoes that were ripening faster than I could eat them. This was easy and worked well as a pancake topping. Had no OJ so substituted passion fruit juice for a little more tropical taste. Felt like the butter overshadowed the fresh fruit taste and will definitely leave it out next time.",
            "datePublished": "2009-07-17T06:21:38.423Z"
